
//Method list of validation rules
Validation rule System Validation ke baad aur Triggers se pehle chalta hai. Iska matlab agar Validation fail hua, toh Trigger chalne ki nobat hi nahi aayegi.

Function,Description,Example (Error tab aayega jab...)
AND(),Saari conditions true honi chahiye.,"AND(IsClosed, ISBLANK(Reason__c))"
OR(),Koi bhi ek condition true ho jaye.,"OR(Amount < 10, Amount > 1000)"
NOT(),"True ko False, False ko True kar deta hai.",NOT(ISNUMBER(PostalCode))
IF(),"Agar aisa hai toh ye, warna wo.","IF(Amount > 100, True, False)"
CASE(),Ek field ki alag-alag values check karna.,"CASE(Priority, ""High"", 1, ""Low"", 0, 0) = 1"


Function,Description,Example
ISBLANK(),Check karta hai field khali hai ya nahi.,ISBLANK(Phone)
ISNUMBER(),Check karta hai sirf number hain ya nahi.,NOT(ISNUMBER(EmployeeID__c))
ISPICKVAL(),Picklist value check karne ke liye.,"ISPICKVAL(Status, ""Open"")"
INCLUDES(),Multi-select picklist mein value check karna.,"INCLUDES(Interests__c, ""Sports"")"
TEXT(),Number/Picklist ko text mein badalna.,"TEXT(Quantity__c) = ""10"""
REGEX(),Pattern matching (Email/Phone format).,"NOT(REGEX(Email, "".*@.*\.com""))"
CONTAINS(),Check karta hai text mein wo word hai ya nahi.,"CONTAINS(Description, ""Free"")"
BEGINS(),Kya text is word se shuru ho raha hai?,"BEGINS(AccountNumber, ""ACT"")"
LEN(),Text ki length (lambai) batata hai.,LEN(Aadhar__c) != 12
LOWER() / UPPER(),Chhoti ya badi ABC mein badalna.,"UPPER(Country) != ""INDIA"""
MID() / LEFT() / RIGHT(),"Beech, shuru ya aakhiri se words nikalna.","LEFT(Phone, 3) = ""91"""
TRIM(),Faltu ke spaces (khali jagah) hatana.,LEN(TRIM(Name)) < 3
SUBSTITUTE(),Ek word ko dusre se badalna.,"SUBSTITUTE(Name, "" "", """")"
VALUE(),Text ko number mein badalna.,VALUE(Text_Field__c) > 100


Function,Description,Example
DATE(),"Saal, Mahina, Din se date banana.","DATE(2025, 12, 31)"
DATEVALUE(),Text ya Date/Time ko Date mein badalna.,DATEVALUE(CreatedDate) = TODAY()
DATETIMEVALUE(),Kisi value ko Date/Time format mein lana.,"DATETIMEVALUE(""2025-01-01 12:00:00"")"
TODAY(),Aaj ki date.,CloseDate < TODAY()
NOW(),Abhi ka time aur date.,Expiry__c < NOW()
DAY() / MONTH() / YEAR(),"Date mein se din, mahina ya saal nikalna.",MONTH(TODAY()) = 1
WEEKDAY(),"Hafte ka kaunsa din hai (1=Sun, 7=Sat).",WEEKDAY(TODAY()) = 1 (Sunday block)


Function,Description,Example
ABS(),Negative number ko positive banana (-5 ko 5).,ABS(Balance__c) > 100
CEILING() / FLOOR(),Round up ya Round down karna.,CEILING(10.2) = 11
ROUND(),Pass wale number par round karna.,"ROUND(Amount, 2)"
SQRT(),Square root nikalna.,SQRT(Area__c)
MAX() / MIN(),Sabse bada ya sabse chhota dhoondna.,"MAX(Price1, Price2) > 500"
MOD(),Bacha hua (Remainder) nikalna.,"MOD(Quantity, 2) != 0 (Odd check)"
EXP() / LN() / LOG(),Advanced math (Exponential/Log).,LOG(Amount)

Function,Description,Example
ISCHANGED(),Check karta hai ki field ki value badli hai ya nahi.,ISCHANGED(Rating)
PRIORVALUE(),Badalne se pehle purani value kya thi?,PRIORVALUE(Amount) > Amount
VLOOKUP(),Dusre Custom Object se data match karna.,VLOOKUP(...)
GETSESSIONID(),Current user ki session ID nikalna.,(Sirf Formula fields mein zyada use hota hai)
ADDMONTHS(),Date mein mahine jodne ke liye.,"ADDMONTHS(StartDate, 12)"
MCEILING / MFLOOR,Mathematical precision ke liye.,MCEILING(Value)